VR venue.\n\nThe catalog includes T-Pain, Buddy Guy, Yelawolf, Soulja Boy, Jim Jones, Waka Flocka Flame, Norma Jean, Tank, and more. Plus stand-up you can put in the same lineup.\n\nFree to download and explore. Unlock premier performances with one-off purchases or a monthly or yearly subscription.\n\nSoapbox is the only way to have your favorite artists appear life-size in your space.", "short_description": "New users get 3 days free!\n\nLife-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Build an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances, and watch them appear in mixed reality or a full VR venue. No avatars - volumetric captures of the actual artists. \n\nFree to download, with a catalog you can explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "splash_portrait.png", "id": "1770420413866405", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1770420417199738_9163659578469219972_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W5Ws6bu6J-cQ7kNvwGKG7MY&_nc_oc=Adq3VV7TP_yCUVCstb-cVmnq2LTQ-x8dG41gKpQGG_9mACX0b2ZWus7jwBKN-K7i3JA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS2vSITCUeeq4QyzESGyfJszcrgPSUBuXQIlPEKEpdqEw&oe=6B070CB5"}, {"file_name": "splash_square.png", "id": "1433199797716384", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1433199801049717_1165102973676556133_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hBQp6gD9BU0Q7kNvwE_EkNy&_nc_oc=AdrNoXfuYHqZGeH_fC66J9vylC9AmwxgNhflKle99wO0P4wBYAn3xaqxe2XbwqHxnZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSZCdi2hduCqBnxp-SxvnbxmVNWo7U7X6SgBrrCCF4qDg&oe=6B070605"}, {"file_name": "meta banner.png", "id": "1408416804241288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1408416807574621_5283805827554035897_n.png?_nc_ca